---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<BaseLayout>

<!-- ══ NAVBAR ══ -->
<nav class="nav" id="navbar">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a href="/" class="nav-logo">
      <div class="nav-logo-icon">🌱</div>
      <span class="nav-logo-text">Little Sprout</span>
    </a>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#philosophy">Tentang</a></li>
      <li><a href="#programs">Programs</a></li>
      <li><a href="#curriculum">Kurikulum</a></li>
      <li><a href="#facilities">Fasilitas</a></li>
      <li><a href="#tuition">Biaya</a></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="nav-right">
      <a href="#booking" class="btn btn-primary btn-pill">Book Campus Tour</a>
      <button class="hamburger" aria-label="Menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ══ HERO ══ -->
<section class="hero" id="hero">
  <div class="hero-photo">
    <img
      src="https://picsum.photos/seed/littlesprout-hero/1920/1080"
      alt="Anak-anak belajar dengan gembira di Little Sprout Preschool"
      width="1920" height="1080"
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">🌱 Preschool &amp; TK Bilingual · Jakarta · BSD · Surabaya</div>
    <h1 class="hero-h1">Setiap Anak Berhak<br />Tumbuh Dengan<br />Rasa Ingin Tahu.</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      Preschool &amp; TK dengan kurikulum Reggio Emilia + Montessori.<br />
      Usia 2–6 tahun · Bilingual ID-EN · Guru bersertifikat ECCD.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#booking" class="btn btn-primary">Schedule Campus Tour</a>
      <a href="#programs" class="btn btn-outline--white">Lihat Program</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-trust">
      <span class="trust-pill">⭐ 12+ Tahun</span>
      <span class="trust-pill">🏆 Akreditasi A</span>
      <span class="trust-pill">📜 ECCD Certified</span>
      <span class="trust-pill">🌍 Bilingual ID-EN</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ ACCREDITATION STRIP ══ -->
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="accred-strip">
    <span class="accred-label">Diakui oleh</span>
    <div class="accred-items">
      <span class="accred-item">🏅 Akreditasi A Kemendikbud</span>
      <span class="accred-item">🌐 IECA Member</span>
      <span class="accred-item">📋 ECCD Certified</span>
      <span class="accred-item">🛡️ Halal Certified Meals</span>
      <span class="accred-item">📊 Reggio Emilia Network</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══ PHILOSOPHY ══ -->
<section class="section" id="philosophy">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="sec-label">Filosofi Kami</p>
      <h2 class="sec-title">Belajar Bukan Tentang Menjejalkan.<br />Tapi Tentang Menumbuhkan.</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">Kami menggabungkan Reggio Emilia, Montessori, dan play-based learning — karena ketiganya bukan pilihan, tapi pelengkap.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="philosophy-grid">
      <div class="philosophy-card">
        <div class="philosophy-icon">🌱</div>
        <h3 class="philosophy-title">Child-Led Learning</h3>
        <p class="philosophy-body">Anak menentukan minat. Guru mendampingi, bukan memerintah. Kurikulum fleksibel sesuai exploration anak — karena setiap anak punya cara belajar yang unik.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="philosophy-card">
        <div class="philosophy-icon">🎨</div>
        <h3 class="philosophy-title">Learn Through Play</h3>
        <p class="philosophy-body">Semua pembelajaran via play — building, art, music, outdoor. Karena play adalah cara anak memahami dunia. Bukan distraksi dari belajar, tapi belajar itu sendiri.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="philosophy-card">
        <div class="philosophy-icon">🌍</div>
        <h3 class="philosophy-title">Whole-Child Development</h3>
        <p class="philosophy-body">Bukan hanya cognitive. Social-emotional, physical, creative — semua sama pentingnya. Kami mendampingi tumbuh kembang anak secara menyeluruh, bukan sekedar akademis.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ PROGRAMS ══ -->
<section class="section section--soft" id="programs">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="sec-label">Program Kami</p>
      <h2 class="sec-title">Program Sesuai Usia</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">Setiap kelas dirancang untuk milestone tumbuh kembang spesifik. Temukan program yang tepat untuk si kecil.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="programs-grid">
      <article class="prog-card">
        <div class="prog-photo">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/toddler-class/400/300" alt="Toddler Class" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="prog-badge">👶 Toddler Class</span>
        </div>
        <div class="prog-meta">
          <h3 class="prog-title">Toddler Class</h3>
          <p class="prog-age">Usia 2–3 tahun</p>
          <ul class="prog-details">
            <li>Rasio guru 1:4</li>
            <li>Half-day · 08:30–11:30</li>
            <li>Motorik, vocabulary, social play</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="prog-price">Rp 2,8 jt <em>/bulan</em></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="prog-card">
        <div class="prog-photo">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/nursery-kids/400/300" alt="Nursery Class" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="prog-badge">🌸 Nursery</span>
        </div>
        <div class="prog-meta">
          <h3 class="prog-title">Nursery</h3>
          <p class="prog-age">Usia 3–4 tahun</p>
          <ul class="prog-details">
            <li>Rasio guru 1:6</li>
            <li>Half-day atau Full-day (s/d 14:00)</li>
            <li>Language, fine motor, friendship</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="prog-price">Rp 3,2–4,5 jt <em>/bulan</em></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="prog-card">
        <div class="prog-photo">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/prek-learning/400/300" alt="Pre-K Class" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="prog-badge">🌻 Pre-K</span>
        </div>
        <div class="prog-meta">
          <h3 class="prog-title">Pre-K</h3>
          <p class="prog-age">Usia 4–5 tahun</p>
          <ul class="prog-details">
            <li>Rasio guru 1:8</li>
            <li>Full-day · 08:30–14:30</li>
            <li>Literacy, numeracy, creative</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="prog-price">Rp 4,5–5,5 jt <em>/bulan</em></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="prog-card">
        <div class="prog-photo">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/kinder-class/400/300" alt="Kindergarten Class" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="prog-badge">🌳 Kindergarten</span>
        </div>
        <div class="prog-meta">
          <h3 class="prog-title">Kindergarten / TK B</h3>
          <p class="prog-age">Usia 5–6 tahun</p>
          <ul class="prog-details">
            <li>Rasio guru 1:10</li>
            <li>Full-day · 08:30–15:00</li>
            <li>School readiness, reading &amp; writing</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="prog-price">Rp 5,5–6,8 jt <em>/bulan</em></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ CURRICULUM ══ -->
<section class="section" id="curriculum">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="sec-label">Kurikulum</p>
      <h2 class="sec-title">Kurikulum Kami</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">Bukan kurikulum cookie-cutter. Kombinasi pendekatan terbaik untuk early childhood development.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="curr-grid">
      <div class="curr-card">
        <div class="curr-icon">🎨</div>
        <h3 class="curr-title">Reggio Emilia Approach</h3>
        <p class="curr-desc">Anak sebagai aktif protagonis. Learning melalui project &amp; investigasi. Guru sebagai fasilitator eksplorasi, bukan pemberi instruksi.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="curr-card">
        <div class="curr-icon">📐</div>
        <h3 class="curr-title">Montessori Method</h3>
        <p class="curr-desc">Lingkungan terstruktur dengan material self-correcting. Mengasah konsentrasi &amp; kemandirian sejak usia dini.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="curr-card">
        <div class="curr-icon">🎭</div>
        <h3 class="curr-title">Play-Based Learning</h3>
        <p class="curr-desc">Free play, guided play, dan structured play. Karena play adalah cara anak membangun pemahaman terhadap dunianya.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="curr-card">
        <div class="curr-icon">🌍</div>
        <h3 class="curr-title">Bilingual ID-EN</h3>
        <p class="curr-desc">Native English teacher di setiap kelas. Bahasa Indonesia sebagai mother tongue tetap dilestarikan. Natural dan menyenangkan.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="curr-card">
        <div class="curr-icon">🧘</div>
        <h3 class="curr-title">Mindfulness &amp; SEL</h3>
        <p class="curr-desc">Yoga pagi, breathing exercise, dan social-emotional learning. Anak belajar mengenali dan mengelola emosinya sendiri.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="curr-card">
        <div class="curr-icon">🏃</div>
        <h3 class="curr-title">Outdoor &amp; Nature</h3>
        <p class="curr-desc">Minimum 1 jam outdoor setiap hari. Garden, sandpit, climbing, nature exploration. Koneksi dengan alam adalah kurikulum kami.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ DAILY SCHEDULE ══ -->
<section class="section section--soft" id="daily">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head sec-head--center">
      <p class="sec-label">Jadwal Harian</p>
      <h2 class="sec-title">Sehari Di Little Sprout</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">Jadwal yang dirancang dengan ritme anak — bukan jadwal kantor.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-time">08:30</div>
        <div class="tl-dot"></div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <div class="tl-activity">👋 Welcome &amp; Free Play</div>
          <div class="tl-desc">Anak tiba, bebas bereksplorasi di lingkungan yang sudah disiapkan guru.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-time">09:00</div>
        <div class="tl-dot"></div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <div class="tl-activity">🧘 Morning Circle</div>
          <div class="tl-desc">Yoga ringan, lagu bersama, sharing pagi. Membangun koneksi dan kesiapan belajar.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-time">09:30</div>
        <div class="tl-dot"></div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <div class="tl-activity">🎨 Project Time</div>
          <div class="tl-desc">Theme-based learning mendalam — investigasi, eksperimen, eksplorasi kreatif.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-time">10:30</div>
        <div class="tl-dot"></div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <div class="tl-activity">🍎 Healthy Snack &amp; Conversation</div>
          <div class="tl-desc">Snack bergizi + percakapan ringan untuk membangun social skills.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-time">11:00</div>
        <div class="tl-dot"></div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <div class="tl-activity">🏃 Outdoor Play &amp; Nature</div>
          <div class="tl-desc">Gerak bebas di luar — climbing, sandpit, garden, eksplorasi alam.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-time">12:00</div>
        <div class="tl-dot"></div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <div class="tl-activity">🍱 Lunch</div>
          <div class="tl-desc">Makan siang catering halal bergizi. Allergy-friendly options tersedia.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-time">12:45</div>
        <div class="tl-dot"></div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <div class="tl-activity">😴 Quiet Time / Nap</div>
          <div class="tl-desc">Untuk program full-day. Istirahat penting bagi tumbuh kembang optimal.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-time">14:00</div>
        <div class="tl-dot"></div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <div class="tl-activity">🎭 Creative Expression</div>
          <div class="tl-desc">Art, music, drama — ekspresi diri melalui berbagai media kreatif.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-time">15:00</div>
        <div class="tl-dot"></div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <div class="tl-activity">🏠 Pickup Time</div>
          <div class="tl-desc">Hari yang penuh makna berakhir. Daily report via app langsung ke orangtua.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ TEACHERS ══ -->
<section class="section" id="teachers">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="sec-label">Tim Pengajar</p>
      <h2 class="sec-title">Tim Guru Kami</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">Pendidik bersertifikat ECCD, berpengalaman, dan penyayang. Rasio guru-siswa di atas standar industri.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="teachers-grid">
      <article class="teacher-card">
        <div class="teacher-photo">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/teacher-linda/300/400" alt="Ms. Linda Hartono" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="teacher-meta">
          <div class="teacher-name">Ms. Linda Hartono, M.Ed.</div>
          <div class="teacher-role">Director &amp; Principal</div>
          <div class="teacher-creds">S2 Early Childhood Education · 15+ tahun</div>
          <div class="teacher-langs"><span class="lang-chip">🇮🇩 ID</span><span class="lang-chip">🇬🇧 EN</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="teacher-card">
        <div class="teacher-photo">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/teacher-sarah/300/400" alt="Ms. Sarah Thompson" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="teacher-meta">
          <div class="teacher-name">Ms. Sarah Thompson</div>
          <div class="teacher-role">Lead Teacher Pre-K</div>
          <div class="teacher-creds">Native English · Australia</div>
          <div class="teacher-langs"><span class="lang-chip">🇬🇧 EN</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="teacher-card">
        <div class="teacher-photo">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/teacher-putri/300/400" alt="Ms. Putri Wulandari" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="teacher-meta">
          <div class="teacher-name">Ms. Putri Wulandari, S.Pd.</div>
          <div class="teacher-role">Lead Teacher Nursery</div>
          <div class="teacher-creds">S1 PAUD UPI · ECCD Certified</div>
          <div class="teacher-langs"><span class="lang-chip">🇮🇩 ID</span><span class="lang-chip">🇬🇧 EN</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="teacher-card">
        <div class="teacher-photo">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/teacher-lia/300/400" alt="Ms. Lia Indriani" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="teacher-meta">
          <div class="teacher-name">Ms. Lia Indriani, Psikolog</div>
          <div class="teacher-role">Child Psychologist</div>
          <div class="teacher-creds">Konsultan Tumbuh Kembang</div>
          <div class="teacher-langs"><span class="lang-chip">🇮🇩 ID</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ FACILITIES ══ -->
<section class="section section--soft" id="facilities">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="sec-label">Fasilitas</p>
      <h2 class="sec-title">Lingkungan Yang Mendukung<br />Tumbuh Kembang</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">Setiap sudut dirancang untuk mendukung eksplorasi, kreativitas, dan kenyamanan anak.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fac-grid">
      <article class="fac-card">
        <div class="fac-photo"><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/classroom-bright/800/600" alt="Indoor Classroom" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="fac-meta">
          <div class="fac-icon">🏫</div>
          <h3 class="fac-title">Indoor Classrooms</h3>
          <p class="fac-desc">4 ruang kelas natural light, Montessori material lengkap, reading corner 500+ buku, AC &amp; ventilasi optimal.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="fac-card">
        <div class="fac-photo"><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/outdoor-play/800/600" alt="Outdoor Playground" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="fac-meta">
          <div class="fac-icon">🌳</div>
          <h3 class="fac-title">Outdoor Playground</h3>
          <p class="fac-desc">600 m² outdoor space — sandpit, climbing structure, swings, garden planting, shade &amp; water station.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="fac-card">
        <div class="fac-photo"><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/art-studio/800/600" alt="Art Studio" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="fac-meta">
          <div class="fac-icon">🎨</div>
          <h3 class="fac-title">Art &amp; Creative Studio</h3>
          <p class="fac-desc">Ruang art dedicated — easels, clay, fabric, recyclable materials. Display wall untuk karya setiap anak.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="fac-card">
        <div class="fac-photo"><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/music-room/800/600" alt="Music Room" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="fac-meta">
          <div class="fac-icon">🎵</div>
          <h3 class="fac-title">Music &amp; Movement Room</h3>
          <p class="fac-desc">Wooden floor untuk dance &amp; yoga. Alat musik — keyboard, drums, ukulele. Sound system professional.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="fac-card">
        <div class="fac-photo"><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/library-corner/800/600" alt="Library" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="fac-meta">
          <div class="fac-icon">📚</div>
          <h3 class="fac-title">Library Corner</h3>
          <p class="fac-desc">1.000+ buku bilingual, reading nook cozy, storytelling sessions mingguan bersama guru.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="fac-card">
        <div class="fac-photo"><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/school-dining/800/600" alt="Dining Area" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="fac-meta">
          <div class="fac-icon">🍽️</div>
          <h3 class="fac-title">Dining &amp; Kitchen</h3>
          <p class="fac-desc">Catering halal certified, healthy meals, allergy-friendly options, snack time included setiap hari.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="safety-band">
      <span class="safety-label">🛡️ Keamanan</span>
      <div class="safety-items">
        <span class="safety-item">CCTV di setiap area</span>
        <span class="safety-item">Health screening harian</span>
        <span class="safety-item">Secure access keycard</span>
        <span class="safety-item">All staff First Aid certified</span>
        <span class="safety-item">Secure pickup protocol</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ TUITION ══ -->
<section class="section" id="tuition">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="sec-label">Biaya Pendidikan</p>
      <h2 class="sec-title">Transparent Pricing.<br />Tidak Ada Hidden Fee.</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">Investasi terbaik untuk tumbuh kembang si kecil dimulai dari sini.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tuition-grid">
      <div>
        <table class="tuition-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Program</th>
              <th>Bulanan</th>
              <th>Tahunan <span style="font-weight:400;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:10px">(Hemat 10%)</span></th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Toddler Half-day</td><td class="price">Rp 2,8 jt</td><td class="annual">Rp 30 jt</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Nursery Half-day</td><td class="price">Rp 3,2 jt</td><td class="annual">Rp 35 jt</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Nursery Full-day</td><td class="price">Rp 4,5 jt</td><td class="annual">Rp 49 jt</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Pre-K</td><td class="price">Rp 5 jt</td><td class="annual">Rp 54 jt</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Kindergarten</td><td class="price">Rp 6 jt</td><td class="annual">Rp 65 jt</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <div style="margin-top:28px;">
          <p style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--c-ink);margin-bottom:10px;">One-time Fee (per tahun ajaran)</p>
          <table class="tuition-table">
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>Registrasi</td><td class="price">Rp 3 jt</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Material &amp; Seragam Tahunan</td><td class="price">Rp 5 jt</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Activity Fee (excursion, events)</td><td class="price">Rp 3 jt</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="includes-box">
        <p class="includes-title">Sudah termasuk:</p>
        <ul class="check-list" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
          <li>Healthy meals (lunch + snack)</li>
          <li>All learning materials</li>
          <li>2 sets uniform (school + sport)</li>
          <li>Quarterly parent meeting</li>
          <li>Year-end show &amp; exhibition</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--c-ink);margin-bottom:8px;">Tidak termasuk:</p>
        <ul class="dash-list" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
          <li>Transportasi (private +Rp 1,5 jt/bln)</li>
          <li>Field trip extra</li>
          <li>Summer camp</li>
        </ul>
